{"id": "unknown-2026-07-14-002", "date": "2026-07-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 29, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["cotton_price"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["concerns"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "ICE cotton pauses after strong rally, weather concerns persist", "content": "ICE cotton futures paused after last week's strong rally, with the December 2026 contract slipping 0.03 cent to 81.51 cents while holding most of its weekly gains.\nHot, dry weather in West Texas and declining US crop ratings supported prices despite bearish USDA WASDE estimates.\nHigher crude oil prices and lower ICE certified stocks also underpinned the market.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/ice-cotton-pauses-after-strong-rally-weather-concerns-persist-311718-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-14-003", "date": "2026-07-14", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 29, "weekday": "Tue"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India could unlock $9.4 bn from textile waste—but isn’t", "content": "India generates 7.073 million tonnes of textile waste annually, yet recyclers still imported $269.5 million of textile scrap in 2025 because overseas material arrives sorted, traceable and commercially usable.\nThe challenge is not waste availability but collection, sorting and fibre identification, leaving a potential $9.4 billion circular-economy value gap untapped.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-could-unlock-9-4-bn-from-textile-waste-but-isn-t-311717-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
